# HomeGuard Rule List
# =====================================================================
# Routing strategy:
#   1. LAN / local addresses     -> DIRECT
#   2. US-based AI services      -> SS-US
#   3. Chinese popular services  -> DIRECT
#   4. Other foreign services    -> SS-HK
#   5. GEOIP,CN                  -> DIRECT  (catch any CN IP not listed)
#   6. FINAL                     -> SS-HK   (default for unknown)
#
# Rules are evaluated top-to-bottom, FIRST MATCH WINS. So:
#   - more-specific rules go above more-general ones
#   - the AI block must precede the Google/Bing keyword rules in §4
#
# Syntax: <TYPE>,<PATTERN>,<POLICY>[,no-resolve]
# Policy names are case-insensitive at parse time but stored upper-case,
# so they must match the proxy-group names in homeguard.toml (SS-HK / SS-US).
# =====================================================================


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. LAN / loopback / private — never proxy these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,local,DIRECT
IP-CIDR,127.0.0.0/8,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,10.0.0.0/8,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,172.16.0.0/12,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,192.168.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,100.64.0.0/10,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,::1/128,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,fc00::/7,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,fe80::/10,DIRECT,no-resolve


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. US-based AI services -> SS-US
#    (must come BEFORE the Google keyword rule below, otherwise
#     gemini.google.com would hit DOMAIN-KEYWORD,google first)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenAI / ChatGPT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com,SS-US

# Anthropic / Claude
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai,SS-US

# Google AI (Gemini, Bard) — specific subdomains routed before google keyword
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bard.google.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com,SS-US

# Microsoft Copilot / Bing
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bing.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,copilot.microsoft.com,SS-US

# Other popular AI / dev-AI tools
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,perplexity.ai,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,poe.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huggingface.co,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,replicate.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.sh,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cursor.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,codeium.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,midjourney.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,runwayml.com,SS-US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stability.ai,SS-US


